OL,3,GNEWSASon charged with murdering parents
OL,4,Ain own home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murdering
OL,7,Fhis parents in their own home.
OL,9,FIsmail Ahmed Yeli, 80, and 78-year-old
OL,10,FFatma Leli were found stabbed to death
OL,11,Fin a house on Hardman Street in
OL,12,FBlackburn on Monday, Lancashire Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FTheir family described the couple as
OL,16,F"inseparable", adding they were
OL,17,F"heartbroken" to have lost "the oldest
OL,18,Fand most cherished members of our
OL,19,Ffamily".
